      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you set BOTH `Normals` and `Blend Shape Normals` to `Import` on your Mesh Import settings, the SDK will not warn you about it whatsoever. Many Avatar Creators I know use this method instead of Legacy these days.",
