      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name}  \n\nAuto smooth does not really *exist* in the normal way in blender 4.4.3\n\nguide/rules in vrchat avatar sdk to give proper blender settings for export could be handy to know\n\nI attached my known export settings\n\nI generally hit  f3 to reset vectors\n\nThen make sure my normal faces are right\n\nthen go mesh--> normals-->set from faces\n\nthen go mesh-->Shading-->smooth faces\n\n(i also make sure if i have shapekeys to do this when basis is selected!\n\nadvise if this is the *correct way* generally for blender-->unity-->vrchat",
