      "value": "@{5f4773dac246b672791386d7|full_name}\n\nI can add that so far i have had no issues with blender 4.4.3\n\nsee my post that shows my settings and methods around my export settings\n\nI can confirm though that my model does not have any normals to import for blendshapes ? (i guess id have to go through all of my blenshapes and add normals settings but i didnt)\n\nso this is what my normals look like with blenshape normals imported (i get no warning in sdk aswell)  \n\nsetting to blend shape normal calculate and my body breaks badly\n\nsetting to none fixes everything\n\nhuge detailed shape keys suffer in a different way.\n\nits why if avatars make necks to join body/head  they got to be careful of the visemes effect the neck too much",
