      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} FBX exporting has had issues in the past with regards to how it exports normals. It should be changed in 4.5, but besides this the point of having it set to None is if Unity deprecates the `LegacyBlendShapeNormals` option in the FBX import settings",
